Z||000007||Oreif||07-07-2000||11:34 PM||||I figured it would be easier for people to figure it out with the Logo signature. I actually had someone think it was a middle east name!<P>Rick, also remember the piston difference between 3.1 and 2.8 is dependent on which heads you use. Aluminum heads use stock 3.1 pistons, Cast heads require new pistons. (Silovite model 1486) For a 3.4 you use the original heads and pistons on the 3.4.<P><BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">   <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-07-2000).]||||reg||1
